    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing Sudoku and Futoshiki is a calming casual web game that merges the logic of Sudoku and Futoshiki into a serene sakura garden theme. Players solve puzzles in a tranquil setting filled with soft pastels, fluttering petals, and soothing music, with adjustable difficulty and hint systems to ensure a stress-free, frustration-free experience. The game balances mindful challenges with peaceful visuals and soundscapes, offering a gentle escape for puzzle enthusiasts seeking relaxation and mental clarity.</p>",
